        ],
      },
    ],
    versus: {
      title: 'When each one makes&nbsp;sense',
      lead: 'No product is best for everyone. This is our honest take, the same one we use when a prospect is not a fit for us.',
      items: [
        {
          name: 'Pick Doctocliq (with Soyla) if...',
          body: 'you need the full clinical suite: patient records with dental charting, treatment estimates and e-invoicing in Peru, Mexico, Colombia or Ecuador. Their WhatsApp AI is solid, but it only works if you move your operation onto Doctocliq, and it does not cover Instagram.',
        },
        {
          name: 'Pick Kura if...',
          body: 'your clinic is in Spain, EU compliance matters to you (GDPR, data in the EU) and WhatsApp is your only channel. It does ad-lead qualification and estimate recovery well. It does not collect deposits or answer Instagram.',
        },
        {
          name: 'Pick Cloudia if...',
          body: 'your clinic is in Brazil or Portugal and you already use one of the 40+ management systems it integrates with. It is the cheapest option. Keep in mind its core is flow-based: generative AI conversation is a paid add-on.',
        },
        {
          name: 'Pick AgendaPro if...',
          body: 'what you want is the scheduling and point-of-sale software, not an assistant that converses: online booking, records, POS, inventory and reports, with thousands of beauty and health businesses across LATAM. Its chatbot answers FAQs; it does not sell or collect for you.',
        },
        {
          name: 'Pick Zenvia if...',
